1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,428
Have you ever noticed…

2
00:00:02,468 --> 00:00:07,298
that lately, your life is only
about getting things done?

3
00:00:08,248 --> 00:00:08,596
But…

4
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:12,279
when will our life
actually be stable?

5
00:00:12,319 --> 00:00:14,121
After a better job?

6
00:00:14,161 --> 00:00:16,543
After a bigger salary?

7
00:00:17,493 --> 00:00:19,103
Because strangely…

8
00:00:19,143 --> 00:00:23,502
every time we reach the
goal we once dreamed of,

9
00:00:23,542 --> 00:00:26,618
there's always a
new one to chase.

10
00:00:26,658 --> 00:00:28,741
And we keep running.

11
00:00:29,691 --> 00:00:30,444
Faster.

12
00:00:30,484 --> 00:00:31,351
Further.

13
00:00:31,391 --> 00:00:32,144
Harder.

14
00:00:32,184 --> 00:00:37,987
As if life were a race
we're not allowed to lose.

15
00:00:39,337 --> 00:00:43,083
But what if the life
we've been waiting for…

16
00:00:43,123 --> 00:00:46,901
is the very life we're
missing right now?

17
00:00:49,351 --> 00:00:51,476
The people you got to hug.

18
00:00:51,516 --> 00:00:54,390
The conversations
you got to enjoy.

19
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:58,927
And the simple days you'll
never be able to repeat.

20
00:00:59,877 --> 00:01:03,268
Don't spend your entire life
trying to make a living…

21
00:01:03,308 --> 00:01:06,083
only to realize you
never really lived.

